Instantly call all of your bloated oozes to your aid.

If you have less than the maximum number of oozes allowed by the Mitosis talent, up to 1 will be created with [31, 38, 43, 46, 49 (TL1-5; CUN 100; MP 100)] life ([42%, 51%, 57%, 62%, 65% (TL1-5)] of the maximum life allowed by Mitosis).

Each ooze created will form near a random foe in sight (no more than one ooze per target) and grab its attention.

This will then allow you to channel a melee attack through your ooze to its target, doing [119%, 139%, 155%, 168%, 180% (TL1-5)] weapon damage (as Acid).
